WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.907 --> 00:00:04.969
(In theaters everywhere tonight.)

00:00:05.884 --> 00:00:07.649
JON JON
Okay, let's get you ready to fight!

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:08.899
SHANG-CHI
Wait, what?

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:11.404
JON JON
We're a multi-platform global operation.

00:00:11.454 --> 00:00:13.854
Every fight livestreamed
on the dark web.

00:00:13.904 --> 00:00:16.425
Thousands of viewers
placing bets as we speak.

00:00:16.475 --> 00:00:18.846
This is gonna take
your brand to a whole new level!

00:00:18.896 --> 00:00:20.425
SHANG-CHI
Think there's been some sort of confusion.

00:00:20.475 --> 00:00:21.764
KATY
I like your spike face.

00:00:22.631 --> 00:00:23.904
JON JON
Usually, you gotta fight your way

00:00:23.955 --> 00:00:26.766
to central ring. But a viral star
like you, front of the line, baby!

00:00:26.816 --> 00:00:28.441
SHANG-CHI
I'm not here to fight anybody.

00:00:28.492 --> 00:00:30.183
Ok? I'm looking
for my sister, Xu Xialing?

00:00:30.234 --> 00:00:31.813
[Crowd cheers]
[Fighter grunts]

00:00:31.863 --> 00:00:32.914
JON JON
Never heard of her.

00:00:32.964 --> 00:00:36.328
We just lost a fighter at the
last minute, so you get the next slot.

00:00:40.332 --> 00:00:41.507
[Painful scream]

00:00:41.558 --> 00:00:42.692
[Fighter yelling]

00:00:43.274 --> 00:00:44.941
JON JON
Nice one, Helen!

00:00:45.704 --> 00:00:47.477
KATY
Is he gonna be fighting in one of these?

00:00:47.528 --> 00:00:48.810
JON JON
Uh, no, no no no.

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:53.136
These are like, low-level fights.
You're gonna be fighting...

00:00:53.758 --> 00:00:55.015
...up there!

